# Malamet Brawler: "Whenever this creature attacks, target attacking creature gains trample until end of turn." Attacking alone, the Brawler
# is the only attacking creature, so it is the target and gains trample (CR 702.19b): blocked by Bot2's Elvish Mystic (1/1), it assigns 1 to the
# Mystic and the other 1 to Bot2, who goes to 19 (no target is asked, there being one legal). At the end of turn
# the trample wears off. The cost is exactly {1}{G}: Forest and Mox Ruby.

